OL,3,GNEWSA'He was a crime scene,' say
OL,4,Abereaved parents recalling son's final
OL,5,Amoments
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a teenager who was
OL,8,Fstabbed and killed at a railway station
OL,9,Fsays the image of paramedics trying to
OL,10,Fsave her son's life is one she will
OL,11,F"never get out of my head for the rest
OL,12,Fof my life".
OL,14,FJosh Ingram, 16, was attacked at
OL,15,FSeaford railway station in East Sussex
OL,16,Fon 10 September 2025, with his killer
OL,17,Fjailed for 14 years for murder in
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
