OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'He was a crime scene,' say
OL,4,Abereaved parents recalling son's final
OL,5,Amoments
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking publicly for the first time,
OL,8,FYvette Bullen, Josh's mother, told BBC
OL,9,FSouth East: "We couldn't say goodbye to
OL,10,Four boy properly, and the main reason
OL,11,Ffor that was because he was a crime
OL,12,Fscene."
OL,14,FJosh's father David Ingram said his son
OL,15,Fwas a "cheeky lad", who was "lovely"
OL,16,Fand "loyal".
